{"ticker":{"symbol":"037270.KS","name":"YG PLUS","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":3185.0,"change_pct":-0.046407185628742464,"market_cap":202767007744.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.009419152276295133,"week52_low":2675.0,"week52_high":8070.0,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":144,"website":"https://www.ygplus.com","business_summary":"YG Plus, Inc. produces and distributes music, MD, and other content. It operates NAVER music platform; VIBE, a platform that conducts music production and investment distribution business; and MIXTAPE, a next-generation digital music distribution platform. The company also provides intellectual property solutions, which includes official music and merchandise store under the YG SELECT name, and official commerce shop under the Weverse Shop, as well as offline channels. In addition, it operates Forest Factory, an entertainment-specialized printing company, as well as financial investment business. The company was formerly known as Phoenix Holdings Inc. The company was founded in 1996 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)와이지플러스는 음악, MD 등의 콘텐츠를 제작, 유통합니다. 네이버 뮤직 플랫폼을 운영하고 있습니다. 음악 제작 및 투자 유통 사업을 수행하는 플랫폼 VIBE; 차세대 디지털 음원 유통 플랫폼 MIXTAPE. 또한, YG SELECT라는 이름의 공식 음반 및 상품 매장, 위버스샵 산하의 공식 커머스 매장, 오프라인 채널 등 지식재산 솔루션도 제공하고 있습니다. 또한 엔터테인먼트 전문 인쇄회사인 포레스트팩토리와 금융투자사업도 운영하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Phoenix Holdings Inc.로 알려졌습니다. 이 회사는 1996년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"광고","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":140221115580.0,"operating_income":6377944880.0,"net_income":11640561240.0,"eps":183.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":223637117240.0,"operating_income":15752326820.0,"net_income":21541796340.0,"eps":340.0},{"period":"20